WEBVTT

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.910
I can't seem to concentrate on my studies,

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:09.450
and final exams are coming up soon...

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.120
It has to be this restlessness...

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.080
What is everyone doing?

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.500
Not much...

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.120
I don't know if it's the sore muscles from
the fight at the festival or we're just out of it,

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.950
but you know, at times like this,

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:29.370
nothing beats taking the kotatsu out
and loafing around under it.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.620
Yakumo, do you want a rice cracker?

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:33.830
Nope.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.700
Takuma, have you been studying since early again?

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:38.620
Uh, kind of.

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:42.160
Um, by the way, shouldn't we do a date today?

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:45.580
What's up, Takumacchi? You want to go on a date?

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:49.790
T..Takuma-kun! Do you want to take Sue for a walk?!

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:49.790
In that case, Takuma-san, would you like
a home cooked meal by yours truly?

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.040
W-well, I-

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.620
I did it!

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:56.790
What did you do, Kururi-chan?

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.500
Well, I've got a major invention!

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.160
A special Kururi-made, fully automatic doctor set!

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.660
It took three months of persistence,

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.120
but Midgarr doesn't have many
raw materials so it took some time!

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.580
It's been a bit since I've seen a Kururi gadget.

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.080
What'd you make this for?

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:16.120
I asked Kururi-chan to make it.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:18.290
Big Sister Futaba!

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:22.580
We'll have more battles, and we can
take care of our bodies at the same time,

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:24.870
I thought it'd be a good chance to have that.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.040
Yakumo, do you want a mikan?

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:27.870
Nope.

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:29.330
Huh?

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:33.910
We're doing Val Love, "Play Doctor!"

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:37.370
So by playing doctor, you mean...

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:40.370
Takuma's the doctor, and we're the patients?

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:41.870
That is correct.

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:44.910
In other words, Takuma can examine
our entire bodies?

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:46.790
That is correct!

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:51.330
I refuse! I absolutely will not do this!

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:52.870
M-me neither...

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:54.290
I'm sleepy, though.

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:56.500
Um, I'd rather not.

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:58.120
Oh dear.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.160
I'll do it.

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:05.080
Let's play doctor! Please allow me to do this!

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:11.410
Still unseen by anyone

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:14.290
In the midst of my dreams

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:22.250
The sweet desire I found is here today as well

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:30.620
From inside of me

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:35.500
Someone screams at you to notice

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:42.330
We stare at one another, at an irritating distance

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:45.580
Alone, I endure

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:48.540
The onslaught of sadness

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:53.450
Though I want to tell you this feeling of love

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:58.580
I can't say a word

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:05.330
Though you're always at my side

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:10.660
Still unseen by anyone

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:13.700
In the midst of my dreams

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:17.540
A strong emotion set aflame

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:23.950
I won't hesitate, I don't want to hesitate

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:28.910
I'll believe in now, and take a step forward

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:33.370
For the sake of myself

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:41.830
Since I caused so much trouble
for everyone at the campus festival,

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:45.620
I have to do what I can to tend to their bodies!

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:49.410
Because I am... their lover!

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.000
Val Love "Play Doctor," initiated!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:50.950
Val Love

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:51.830
Play Doctor

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.120
Initiated

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.160
For Futaba

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:56.830
Well then, I suppose I'll go first.

00:03:57.410 --> 00:04:00.290
I'm in your hands now, Doctor.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.660
I appreciate your trust!

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.080
Just relax now.

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.790
Let's see...

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:15.160
I want to put the stethoscope
against your chest, so... er...

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:18.040
I should take off my clothes, right?

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.160
Okay, go ahead.

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:26.750
I'm not as big as Mutsumi-chan, though.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.830
U-um... P-pardon me!

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:32.700
This is as awkward as I thought it'd be!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:36.250
What kind of decent conversation can I have
with her right now as a lover?

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:41.250
Doctor? Do you think it's necessary
to put your stethoscope there?

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.950
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:49.410
E-Er, y-you know, i-in the past, we used to think
that the Kamakura shogunate started in 1192,

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:53.370
but recently it's been found that
the Kamakura shogunate was formed in 1185.

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:55.830
Formed in 1185

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.000
Well then, I'll be going now.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.450
Oh, okay.

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:01.000
You're perfectly healthy.

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:06.450
For Misa

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.660
Now then, Misa-san.

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:06.450
First, take off your clothes.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:08.500
Absolutely not!

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.910
There's nothing wrong with me at all!

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.330
See ya!

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:14.200
N-no!

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:17.200
I have to do an examination!

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:20.500
O-okay! Okay, get your hands off me!

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:24.620
Um... Are you itchy anywhere?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:26.330
Shut it, moron!

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.750
And what the heck are you spreading on me?

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:32.250
A restorative oil specially made by Kururi.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.950
To complete the exam,
I have to rub this oil on her...

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.120
entire body... her entire body.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.040
It... tickles...

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.540
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.040
I mean, thank you!

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.790
That's enough! You idiot!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.540
For Itsuyo

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.910
Well now! I'm ready for anything!

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.040
Let me see.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.910
For you President...

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.120
You get a urine test.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:16.000
Urine... test?

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.370
My schedule is completely full,

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:22.330
so I apologize but will you please
fill this in the corner of this room?

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.950
I have to make sure he doesn't hear me.

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:42.910
I've finished.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:46.080
Then please give it to me.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:49.000
Give this... to you?

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.330
Yes, that's right.

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.830
B-but...

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.950
If you don't give it to me I can't proceed!

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:57.200
Menace

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:57.200
Hurry! Give it! Give it, Give it!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.330
Takuma-san, you're acting so...

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:02.410
sinister!

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:04.450
President?!

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:10.290
For Mutsumi

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:10.290
Let me see, for Mutsumi-san...

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:12.700
I'll check if you have any cavities.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.250
O-okay!

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.410
A dental exam, huh?

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.870
Is my breath okay?

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:24.040
I should have had a piece of gum.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:27.160
Now then, can you open wide for me?

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:35.200
It's so dark I can't see much of anything.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:37.250
I'll go in a bit further.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.500
Alright, looks good. Your teeth looked very nice.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.200
Takuma-kun...

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:59.250
I wanted you to at least turn the lights off!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.750
The lights?

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.120
And for Natsuki-san...

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:04.120
For Natsuki

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:06.120
What is it?

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.620
I'll be measuring your bust, waist, and hips,
so please take off your clo-

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:09.910
How shameful!

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:15.250
Oof

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:12.500
Why is it always me doing things like that?!

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:14.910
I-I'm not the one who can answer that...

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:19.700
But it looks like I can take your
measurements over your underwear.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.330
Oh really?

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:23.000
In that case, I guess...

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.750
Why would I agree to that?!

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.500
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.500
H-h-here I go.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.500
But I'll do it

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:30.540
Just for the record...

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:34.000
This is pretend!
Don't you dare look at the numbers!

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:37.000
She's extremely threatening!

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:40.160
What? Hurry up and do this!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.040
Oh, uh...

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:45.660
I was just thinking about how cute
your underwear is today.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:45.660
Childish

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.410
Y-you think so?

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:50.290
Wh-what's wrong?

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:54.910
Nothing, I'm just glad that I changed into
some that I liked just in case.

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.160
Just in case?

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.500
Shameful!

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:03.540
For Yakumo

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.540
First, I'll take your temperature.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.500
Can I put this under my armpit?

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:10.040
Y-yes, please do that.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:14.040
I somehow feel like I haven't done
a successful exam yet...

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:15.790
I have to hang in there..

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.620
If you want to examine the condition of a body...

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:30.450
I think it's best if you listen to
the beating of the heart.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.250
Uh, well...

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:37.250
What? Big Brother, your heart is
thumping away in there too.

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.330
It's so loud...

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.000
Why's that?

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:44.750
You're so...

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:47.040
perverted.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.000
S

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:51.040
S-sorry about that!

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:55.700
For Kururi

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:54.250
Oh yes, I see.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:58.540
So basically, Big Brother, you were
trying to take care of everyone's health,

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:02.370
but you kept letting them get away
and you can't do any exams.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:08.370
Dejected

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.250
What in the world could I be doing wrong?

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.160
Well.

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:12.120
Guess I've gotta. Kururi's gonna help you out!

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.620
I just gotta push this...

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:15.620
What's this?

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:17.950
I'm a genius inventor, you know!

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:21.330
I've gotta at least add a super examination mode!

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.870
Super examination mode?!

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.790
A device built into the clothing
stimulates acupressure points,

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:29.790
and the doctor can do the work of 100 people!

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:34.870
I feel like I can treat any serious illness now!

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.540
Go get 'em, Big Brother!

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:39.120
This time you can go crazy and do all of the exams!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.000
Roger, Kururi-san!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.870
Th-this can't be happening!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.200
An explosion due to overheating?!

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.410
What?!

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:54.790
It must be because I didn't use
materials from Asgard...

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:56.790
I'll take off this suit for now...

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:58.200
Uh, what?

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.540
I can't get it off!

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:03.830
Oh no... If I don't do something,
Kururi-san will get caught in the explosion!

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:07.450
Takuma-san was kind of strange today.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:11.120
You think so?
I thought he was his typical shameful self.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:15.160
I agree! He may have been
more aggressive than usual...

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:18.410
Takuma?!

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:20.410
Ba doom

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:22.580
Big Brother Takuma!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:28.500
Good grief, how could this have happened?

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.370
Takuma-kun, are you okay?

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:31.620
Oh dear.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.580
I'm sorry, Big Brother!

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:36.410
Don't worry about it.

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:39.870
A doctor hurting himself is pretty ridiculous.

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:43.080
Besides, bluntly speaking, you were creepy today.

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.200
Oh my.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:46.200
He was as creepy as he always is, though.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.790
I didn't really mind...

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:50.000
He was gross and shameful.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.250
And an idiot!

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:52.870
I'm sorry about that.

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.370
But you know...

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:57.870
I appreciate your concern about our health.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.950
Well, there you go, we've played doctor now.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.700
Here, Takuma, open your mouth.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:06.500
Say "ah!"

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:11.450
Val Love "Play Doctor," accomplished, somehow.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.290
Misa's Room

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:19.830
I'm starving.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.830
C'mon, Takuma-san!

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.450
Here's your beef stroganoff snack!

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:28.160
Uh, I just ate lunch...

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.040
Okay, bon appetit!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:33.950
What do you think? Delicious, right?

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:35.200
Right? Right?

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:37.160
How is it, Takuma-san?

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:39.410
I'm sorry!

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:43.500
No need to rush things, Itsuyo.

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:49.450
If you're too forceful, even a fully motivated
Takuma will keep running away.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.410
I-I don't need you to tell me that!

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.910
Oh really? Sorry.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:56.830
Now then...

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.870
Big Sister Misa, I have...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.580
a small favor to ask of you.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:04.410
What?

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:07.160
You want me to show you
an example of a date?

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:11.910
I-it hasn't been that long since I came to Midgard!

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:17.580
And I was just thinking it's necessary to study
what kind of date is prevalent in this world!

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:22.080
What do you mean you haven't been here long?
We both got here on the same day.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:24.580
B-besides, I heard that in the past...

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:31.450
in Asgard, you were a super popular
and gleeful master of romance.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.200
Who did you hear that from?

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.200
Well...

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:41.870
In Asgard, I was told that if I'm having problems,
then I should talk to the romance master!

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:45.910
But I'm not necessarily having problems
or anything, you know!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:49.450
Good grief. Where could she have
heard that rumor from?

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:52.790
I've never even fallen in love or anything!

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:56.750
And even though I was popular, I only got hit on
by other girls and that went nowhere!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.870
I mean I basically didn't even have time
for romance in Asgard!

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:02.750
Asgard

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.910
I can't beat a wild boar by myself!

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:08.660
Help me, sisters!

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:12.580
Since I beat one, there's no reason
you can't do the same.

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:16.250
And that's because you're my little sister!

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:18.330
You'll be fine, Misa-chan.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.290
All you have to do is slaughter it
before you get slaughtered.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:24.910
You pair of combat crazy dimwits...!

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:28.290
My body won't be able to handle
hanging around my sisters at this rate!

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:30.450
I'm sure if I had a younger sister...

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:34.120
they'd push her around instead!

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:37.290
Some years later
Big Sis Misa!

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:39.790
What in the world is going on, Itsuyo?

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:43.910
Um, well, someone in the park was picking on me!

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:46.120
And then Natsuki-chan...

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.160
I chased 'em away!

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.500
So why are you crying Itsuyo-chan?

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:54.000
Because Itsuyo doesn't want you to get hurt.

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.040
What?!

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:56.870
Because, because...

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:58.580
Don't cry about something like that!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.750
You're my big sister, right?

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.290
And I... And I...

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:08.620
H-hey you three, here are some stuffed dolls for you!

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:11.330
Here we go, Kururi! Whee, you're up high!

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:16.830
Really, I miss those times
when I didn't even have time to sleep.

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:18.370
Big Sister Misa?

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:21.160
I can't. I have things I have to do.

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:22.500
Ask someone else.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:26.330
These steps are something you have to
climb up under your own power.

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:29.410
I understand that you're eager to do this
because Natsuki is the only one leveling up,

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:32.410
but we don't know what's going to happen
with that in the future.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.790
At the campus festival...

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.830
I couldn't do a thing.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.580
I was manipulated by the enemy.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:44.830
I'm constantly being protected,
and it's a bother to you, too.

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.040
That's why...

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:51.580
Okay, I'll do it, so stop making that face.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:55.080
Really?! Thanks, Big Sis Mi-

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:57.080
Big Sister Misa!

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:03.080
Misa's Room

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.830
Are you going to fold the laundry?

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:02.950
Yeah.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:05.580
Th-there sure is a lot.

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.580
Because it's for the whole family.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:08.830
Val Love

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:12.000
Val Love, "Spend 1 hour with just
the two of you in the same room,

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:11.830
Spend 1 hour with just the two of you
in the same room

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:15.830
without informing lover," initiated!

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.660
without informing lover

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:15.830
Initiated

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.450
I can at least do this.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:22.750
I hope she'll accept this as an example.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:26.790
Well, this is something I have to do,
so I'll need you to help me with the rest.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:32.750
Is that the stuffed doll that
Natsuki-san asked you for earlier?

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:30.580
Mole-san

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:34.950
Yeah.

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:38.370
I made stuffed dolls for her often when she was a kid.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:43.750
Besides, Natsuki's been made to fight
ever since we got to Midgard.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.120
This is the least I could do.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.370
I see.

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:48.830
A seemingly nicely flowing date is unfolding!

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:51.330
Just as expected from the master of romance!

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:55.370
It looks like this one will take a while.

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:58.200
Meow

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.160
Huh?

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.870
I-it's nothing!

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.830
wobble

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:07.120
He tried really hard during the campus festival,
but his usual self hasn't changed.

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:09.580
How did he manage to survive this long?

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:14.620
Well, I do feel for him, suddenly becoming our lover
and being ordered to save the world and stuff.

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:16.950
I wonder what will happen from here on out?

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.000
A thread, broke?

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.080
Takuma, let me get past you.

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:23.450
O-okay!

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:26.540
Where did my spare go?

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:31.540
Takumacchi, did a blue box fall
somewhere over there?

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:33.790
Huh?! I-I don't see anything!

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.330
Found it!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:39.160
Sorry! You okay?

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.870
Y-yeah, completely fine.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.200
What happened? You stiffened up all of a sudden...

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:48.080
Uh, well, I'm a little dizzy...

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.870
For real?! Did you bump into something funny?

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:52.000
Let me take a look!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.700
Uh, no, it's okay!

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.750
Just let me see!

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:58.330
You've got a little knot here.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.410
If you just leave it alone it'll get better.

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:03.330
Sorry about that, Takuma.

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:04.540
I-it's fine.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:07.910
This pressure is terrible!

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:10.080
I'm feeling kind of lightheaded now...

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:13.910
I'm going outside to get some fresh air.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:14.830
What?!

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:16.950
It hasn't even been an hour yet!

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.950
Wait a second, Takuma!

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:21.660
If you want to take a breather,
then let's play the word chain game!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.120
I'll start!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.410
A-apple!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.660
Play the word chain game for a break.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:29.120
C'mon, now it's your turn, Takuma!

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:30.870
U-um...

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:35.000
B-boobs... Yours are on me!

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:38.000
And I've been able to see, uh...

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:40.450
some other things from the gaps in your clothes!

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:43.870
rumble

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:43.870
Oh crap! I'm going to get punched!

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:45.790
Oh no, I'm sorry!

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:48.160
I didn't mean to make you feel weird.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.120
I'll be more careful from now on!

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:52.500
You're not going to punch me or anything?

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:54.370
I wouldn't do something like that!

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:56.120
C'mon, let's get back to our chores.

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:58.870
She's different from Natsuki-san.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:03.330
I-I'm so embarrassed! What am I doing?

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.790
I'm supposed to be showing Itsuyo
an example of a date, right?!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.950
You can't show her your disgraceful side, Misa!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.540
Let's do this, Oltlinde!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.540
I'm learning so much!

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:14.540
This is awkward.

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:18.200
I should've worn something that fit better.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:22.080
But if I changed right now,
it'd look like I'm doing it intentionally.

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.620
He's not looking, is he? He's not, right?!

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:26.950
Right! Then it's okay! Maybe.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:30.790
But still, this uneasy feeling...

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:33.290
Is this what a date is?

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:36.500
I don't know, since I've never really had
contact with the opposite sex.

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:40.000
Even so, I still can't imagine being in love with Takuma.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:44.160
It's not so much love as... what can I call it...
ugh whatever, I don't know!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.580
I need this hour to hurry up and be over!

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:51.290
Ugh, man, really, what am I doing?!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.160
Misa-san.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.620
His face is close!

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.910
Y-you can't go in there!

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:04.540
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.000
S-sorry!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.660
What did you want?!

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:11.580
Um, I'm done folding the laundry.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.370
Huh? Already?

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:15.790
That was quick.

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:17.620
And it's neatly done, too.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:22.120
Until all of you came here,
I managed all of the housework on my own.

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:26.120
I lost my mother early...

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.500
His hands look so rough...

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:30.660
I see.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:33.450
He's been living here this whole time.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.660
In this huge house...

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.160
all by himself.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:45.750
Hey Natsuki. Thanks for always,
always working hard.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:50.290
Yay, thanks, Big Sister Misa! I'll cherish this!

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.040
I'm glad it made her happy.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:54.000
Yeah, same.

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:55.870
Takuma?

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:56.870
Yes?

00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:58.870
I've got one to give you, too.

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:01.290
Huh? Uh...

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:04.080
Well, I guess, er...

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:08.000
I think it's bad that you got involved with our battles...

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:11.000
And I think that it'll continue to be
a nuisance to you for now, but...

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:13.370
I hope you'll keep helping us in future battles.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:16.450
S-same here! I hope I can keep helping!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.750
Yeah!

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:23.700
You did fairly well, Big Sister Misa!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:27.160
I can't believe I was witness to such a brilliant date!

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:30.160
I-I'm exhausted...

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:35.000
Val Love, "Spend 1 hour with just the two of you
in the same room," narrowly accomplished.

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:39.500
Up-date! Date! Date! Please, please!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:42.750
Heart! Heart! Heart! Please, please!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:49.290
If we don't understand love,
you & I won't get anywhere, you know?

00:21:50.830 --> 00:22:01.790
Nine times out of love on cloud nine

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:03.870
We wanna share your heart!

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:07.120
(How do you tell me?)
Input sweet nothings

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:10.250
Failed - Cancelled - They don't resonate at all
(Please don't be shy)

00:22:10.250 --> 00:22:13.450
(How to make dream)
Touch me and bring me one

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:17.870
Successful - Complete - Isn't cutting-edge tech great?
(Hold me tight)

00:22:17.870 --> 00:22:22.580
Why won't you say romance?

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:25.620
Let's bring it to love

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:32.790
Get more experience and level up my maiden heart

00:22:33.950 --> 00:22:37.500
Up-date! Date! Date! Please, please!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:40.830
Heart! Heart! Heart! Please, please!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:46.790
I'll teach you that love is a maiden's power!
(Love gave the power to Valkyrie)

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:50.330
Nine times out of ten, they're surely already lovers!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:22:50.330 --> 00:22:53.700
Fluttering in my chest, dance, dance!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:56.910
Your shy akuma mind, kiss for you!

00:22:56.910 --> 00:23:00.120
Will completely change, kiss for me!

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:03.500
Let's begin our romance!

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:14.580
I guess I need to do more research to make
Kururi gadgets with the materials in Midgarr.

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:19.870
Big Sis Yakumo, even though we share a room,
I'm always loud, so I'm sorry.

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:21.580
I don't really mind.

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:26.080
However, if you interrupt my sleep,
you're getting punished.

00:23:26.540 --> 00:23:27.950
S-scary...

00:23:29.910 --> 00:23:41.000
Next time: The Strengthening Maiden

00:23:29.910 --> 00:23:32.410
Next time, "The Strengthening Maiden."

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:35.370
Hey, for your next invention, will you make

00:23:35.370 --> 00:23:38.370
something that causes Big Brother even more grief?
